	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Add and tick off tasks in your Sticky notes.

Add a task: type "sticky" followed by the task, pick a sticky, press Enter.

    sticky buy milk

Tick off a task: type "sticky" on its own, pick a sticky, then pick the task.

Requires the Sticky app (with the sticky:// URL scheme) to be installed and run at least once.</string>
